id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41354::$$$message_0280_0000_0000$$$::"L-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]let's run![wvl canskip=0 time=200][br]They do say to keep out of harm's way."::
41355::$$$message_0280_0001_0000$$$::"Just how lies become truth if you stick to them, any misfortune is as good as gone so long as you are able to outrun it."::
41356::$$$message_0280_0002_0000$$$::"Your form is beautiful when you keep running without looking back."::
41357::$$$message_0280_0003_0000$$$::"...I get that you're trying to cheer me up, but...[br]Does that mean it's better than standing still?" ::
41358::$$$message_0280_0004_0000$$$::"Y-[wvl canskip=0 time=600]yes?[wvl canskip=0 time=400][br]As expected from you, Rin."::

